<ComponentPreview name="p-toolbar-1" />

## Installation

<InstallCommand
  pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui"
  shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/toolbar.json"
/>

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import * as Toolbar from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/toolbar";
</script>

<Toolbar.Root aria-label="Formatting">
  <Toolbar.Group aria-label="Text style">
    <Toolbar.Button>Bold</Toolbar.Button>
    <Toolbar.Button>Underline</Toolbar.Button>
  </Toolbar.Group>
  <Toolbar.Separator />
  <Toolbar.Button>Save</Toolbar.Button>
</Toolbar.Root>
```

## API Reference

### Toolbar.Root

Groups controls into one roving-focus toolbar.

### Toolbar.Group

Groups related toolbar items.

### Toolbar.Button

A button in the toolbar focus sequence.

### Toolbar.Separator

A separator perpendicular to the toolbar orientation.

### Toolbar.Link

A link in the toolbar focus sequence.
